  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a3c564ac55cbef843b6ba044b04b37f9, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - Well I hope you had a good first day Agus!
  - Oh and before I forget, you should get your baton before I go, it is on the cabin
    at the end of the path
  - It's for authotized personnel only so grab my key, It's here on the desk inside
    my cabin
  - And tomorrow we'll learn how to use the tranquilizer gun, in the meantime it's
    going to be on Morena's cabin.
  - "Now go get your baton so we can go home, it\xB4s getting late already."
